{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1397,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cab8e8f5d97c5cebc217684",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f00ba4bf6b065f32a697c4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝食べたクロワッサン、バターが\r\n香り高くて素晴らしいお味でした！\r\nあとは焦がしさえしなければ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b22d9e96a30700394f86b6b650fd21ccf8d3694db0089bc40273140d8862fd72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed9e1d3561b09d8d7d2156bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旅行先では時差ボケに注意、です！\r\n前にフランスに行った時、私ったら\r\nお寝坊をしてしまったので…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b9744bde933adc94f50bd16cd04e839712d9df7dfa16a3326f04d4797f58ac0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de0e56746f759cc02b6371a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日のお茶菓子は…マドレーヌ！\r\n旅のお守りがモデルらしいですし、\r\n遠征の際にはもってこい、ですよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e891590ec2e1cafd4812418b918b19a93867b2999efcc7b20c0c6fb34cb45f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8725f50ff51b5f1323f9980e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "リフレッシュして午後も励むため、\r\n昼下がりのお散歩はいかがですか？\r\n私、エスコートいたしますよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aadfca19b04504ac8e0e81b6d06a80327f6a1d7f4c256f971226dd106704ec54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fbd9f5bef9bdb71c6e7ef22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昔見たシャンゼリゼ通りの夜は、\r\nライトアップがとても綺麗で…\r\n近いうちに、一緒に見ましょうね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "658ccb79f740937f5331ff02e15cb0fd7b8e119c5b74e22420c9c5329357d32d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c99244921eeb21ad13ef0b67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Bonsoir ! 大切なあなた。\r\n今宵あなたを守る名誉を、\r\nこの私にいただけませんか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dcc5e1072dd9533566bed7030b209e20c47c9bde8ef7c61b515614737adf3db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:620f3e6f3200265039da18aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、どこかからミモザの香りが…\r\n昔訪れた、プロヴァンスの春を\r\n思い出しますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69048533537419d9f28f4becdf228ffa740e4284514b5236e5636e2c86f97ed3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28041ff65c37aa5f92f3efa1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外はずいぶん暑そうですね…\r\n私の帽子でよければいつでもお貸し\r\nできますから、仰ってくださいね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "829994e732c4327ff98f792c532d9106148f7540258617fc65af7d6f4ebbfd45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed41a065b2fc906e2a0f2497",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "かぼちゃにイチジク、ジロール茸…\r\nフランス遠征の折には、\r\n秋の味覚も楽しみましょうねっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20ce474071443c3983adc83581f5737728cad6ec832945ad9bd5d4fab4e4b138",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ebb60307eded47cb0d32425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゴルシさんは\r\n今ごろ暖かいブラジルでしょうか…\r\nやっぱり同行すればよかったな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ebdb59891b96a5331ca68aeb1da8660fd26937d6d7e5de7d07739d8916eec3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99a7b9f1053da66bab604a13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8e4541e0e8636f1f3a8a83f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我弟弟非常可爱喔。\r\n每当我挑战新事物，他都会不认输地\r\n跟着一起挑战。呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "747c3a9eb6961bb81e73bd9137c22dc2eb06b2b18449d455586b2580ab3be2a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdbaead869bf41d4e349885e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "双亲总是定期寄东西给我，\r\n但房间已经放不下了……\r\n是否该租间仓库呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8afd21adf7e006e120ede06dee52e9a6f13ba45ae4ef992ede727bfbd784f26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:162176523a6f2ad48a4c4526",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说在布丁上淋酱油后吃起来\r\n就跟海胆一样！我可以试试看\r\n是不是真的吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "65b2eacf572ad1c8949019a6824ebcda0ba40e835125363c58b5272928587d6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:487fa8a4567dc3e30e51d16e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正在学习下厨♪\r\n请问下次你愿意帮忙试吃吗？\r\n我一定会让你说出好吃的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4294528ae65fd4419ab19002c8788757f1835baf621d9364d9b569c51814ee6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:836a1608ea325fad03da9c8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我家亲戚很多，\r\n但其中却没几位赛马娘，\r\n这也让我对特雷森学园特别感兴趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d822e6d464c7e9b9e53cbec2a1b09ab411783fce8909423701c5e25deac8e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fa9485a5bcbc818ba9d355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装穿起来好凉。\r\n得喝点热茶\r\n暖暖身子才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fd1eae3d551abfb208fb3e1bbc77981422bea83bf94b4cd3d9aa6a9f6ab4fbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2226767d8124ae9c9e1bfaeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因大家都穿同款服装，为了能在\r\n舞台上更加突出，得好好磨练\r\n自己的表演才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ab73d6202a066c7651b4c0a7a0cfbf62e5e3de286d8721e850ffe4376d783e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0c60ab5a80857f6be6613db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢像荷叶边、缎带之类\r\n可爱的东西。轻飘飘～\r\n摇来摇去～我闹着玩的啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "303b6bc280ff12e85f568b21e9ecef2393e0c6f8b2917c2bccf2775c4be92d86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33bfed4b5532715d3816d03e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套决胜服背负了\r\n家族所有成员的心意……穿着这套\r\n衣服赢得荣耀正是我的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29baa4ab3232c5120920341e7fa2fc6aab9298978fb774187faf8e63eaa6abc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2536c6b3a9829b8a4352fcef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的训练时间我会边听流行乐\r\n边进行。这样有助提神醒脑，\r\n又会觉得心情兴奋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9af3a71d6a2f286edf04b66091c08131db63e29800022aefa6127b1902084ea3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f76ba48b6f845305546e50c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦！接下来是跟麦昆的午茶时光！\r\n希望她会喜欢今天的点心。\r\n呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d181593ce759207337215f226c87585dc7918a2ac4e1d43baf5866d052e998c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ef263c46f9131275ad3408a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时间都这么晚了，\r\n你还在处理什么工作呢？\r\n请问方便让我看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a9e072234f388f76a65856c1de5aa9cef120d8e7e02d0bfee582c995473678d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:963677492d34e4d639daee6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气真暖和，令人坐不住呢……！\r\n要不要一起外出呢？\r\n你觉得如何！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9b46ced5f0ea668750e200bea7efe0006438295ad9a75e5db3fe71c1c5cd7e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:351b8d95fe2d9099d7b9b3bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雨天赛道会变得很难跑呢……\r\n我打算边做点晴天娃娃\r\n边思考对策。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7017b242e1f3d72a3845f96b2150e1456f74aca20e8bd2f2cbf6b34e5f28e42d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8e6322bf72ebf85fe50254c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年巴黎丰收节是不是也很热闹呢？\r\n我们全家曾经一起去，\r\n当时父亲玩得非常愉快呢……呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8cb0343e58e2a926b6eafa9206d8b0a1e6c5e3133c05696763e57b3203d89ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6efa92e60d15fbb7d659bf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "花坛里的花花草草都长出了\r\n可爱的新芽。好期待看到\r\n美丽的花朵盛开呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbe30bddd27ad073611c0b0d7e837676354cf1437c2b3fd1b6cc2224dc8902b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b6e30ca25a33fec3a8eaa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "许多事情都会不断改变呢。无论是\r\n周围的环境，还是目标的终点……\r\n但最重要的心意……是不会改变的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d17a260a44ed768f91edd3280616eb8bc3c0d23bc2c6e636a3a235987f309bcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e08e0032486c757f231391f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也想看草上飞穿巫女服的样子。\r\n她就像是真正的大和抚子，\r\n穿巫女服一定会很好看……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c22472c9daae63b6a2478c6ff2d1ce72414dac48c859ee75a3a51e1234927c4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ef1b785551c7752c4d321cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道特别周食量很大……\r\n但没想到她会误以为五层重箱的\r\n年菜是一人份……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63a41afc96ca13e0341fa43595f5250528d9e1f710e8e7c879a0b9d82f90b06b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:790348349c44ed9e8e726333",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我穿这样出席和麦昆的茶会后，\r\n她称赞了这件衣服的颜色呢♪\r\n耶嘿嘿……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d7490f7f5885091924340a81e932cae0c31b64ceb2ef38177e53ddda8580344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fbf7ac7c1a19876d781d27c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巫女光钻的抽签占卜～♪\r\n训练员今天的运势～～\r\n是大吉呢！祝你有美好的一天～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3298d9dd9f05718bb917ca7d4e7d69077e418d00478a609b63e631773ac6de63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9b90c4a4c45c9e06cbbee8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要一起去神社吗？\r\n在早上的神社洗涤心灵后，\r\n今天也要跟平常一样打破魔咒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbfa979af5a29dec28ef54dcc6ae89dd0673815949108ae681df8230903d26be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9af3db698a06ef1b105dd5b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "通常只要到了中午左右，\r\n我的衣服一定会乱掉……\r\n必须表现得像草上飞那样端庄才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c3dfa89ed12f8af687f8bb05560d47d036ec95ccce27eb7e294295cd27c9ba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f6a635facd97167ecd3a8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，你又熬夜啦？话说……\r\n这件衣服的袖子很像棉被呢。\r\n所以……嘿，快点睡吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0afad403d1ebaa3b2bc6e32f816eb942ba5ae5df10fc0859bb2b5add2f3460a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e0f4e3278b1abd1d1c856b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "崭新的春天，是开始的季节。\r\n新叶开始萌芽，花朵开始绽放……\r\n我也必须努力实现梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6b43b159033d309df3516cf5d8db9452f25d78e6d6a842a720de039844772e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65dc09a4ad2db830f6daf579",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气热的时候果然就是要洒水呢！\r\n我跟小北说好，晚一点要一起\r\n到学园的各处去洒水♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3878e2ef8ce45fa153c644ff797afa3cdbea8221a774ba83f3a93349c1370cca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:551e2cbf5d56c02696a4cb6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天，就会想到秋季祭典……\r\n我未来也想在骏大祭挑战流镝马。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca2ea1d86a6f738923f5ee30d2d245bc58cd49c1024baebc1a5de0ad23f0573",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e78ea7b08ed22bb3a4539f94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然这个季节很冷，但内心会变得\r\n火热。冬天更要燃烧斗志变强！\r\n我现在就是这种心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cbf1e1a315fa2b16c30b1d7350de9f43bf3e0c7f6a21b4e865d9e7e9d43ce3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b986d4ab733b7f809fe8c297",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的腰间有一只乌龟。\r\n希望有一天能够跟它一起，\r\n沐浴在最棒的胜利光芒下♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e78b21496d324ce0882819428b246a790df24b49430513ff69a3556caa1e81e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44727f1ec3ec26168fc3abf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了这件衣服包含的历史……\r\n我现在觉得自己绝对不会输！\r\n无论是比赛，还是板羽球……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88e2c196189d70c335638fe8fb1f1de7540c32678a87fe94851e4fc35ec7c2d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeffd2920be559a7d05ad6ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フランスにも、沢山のレース場が\r\nあるのですよね！以前訪れた\r\nシャンティイも、素敵な所でした！",
      "source_fingerprint": "694260dd7582ea126ad5dc93568a87001a53dc94bcd0a1af58634ffdccde3fb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a4a02e4d4d27a402e9d5220",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日本でもフランスでも、\r\nノブレス・オブリージュの精神で！\r\n我が輝きを届けてまいります！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6c23c8b159cd0fb335a102ef85f12f670f8ea69ec6f6c8e64d6fd4848d649cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da5baf06031710be69ad03fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シリウスさんに、いつか踊ろうと\r\n言っていただいたんです！ふふ、\r\n本当に舞踏会を開こうかしら？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ced7468aea3fb7e15debfc106467cd4b709a1c424eab96def160e9503c0c151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bec4d07c312c49b8b2e557d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キタちゃんへのフランス土産は、\r\n紅茶にお菓子に…ううん、\r\nやっぱりトロフィーが1番だよね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4198f6b995eaed2f90aa94c54e3b832791e4ff9a49587e6526870411c59ee7dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bf4ac17adb6f1e90124086f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フランスとの交換視察で知り合えた\r\n向こうの方々とも、久々にお会い\r\nできるかも…わくわくしますっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d7524b205f885a32a81e5a0839ea7a52e5fc775ca70c40573c123f88cec76a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:092ce084cfc22d31890101f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日はどんな冒険に出かけますか？\r\nせっかくの旅装ですもの、\r\nめいっぱい楽しみませんとっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b5a6f8a29555440d270416272b44f084943216e902cf31cf4f1223bf49b866f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7637669bc2f5279879a63179",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…郊外の森で、お昼寝…\r\nいつかフランスでしたことが…\r\n恋しくなるような陽気ですね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "927626002a2a38b2a05a0b4e5e92703211c02684444f652b0982580f8639083d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e45d31c4c34c0c9b9cdeccee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まあ、夜ふかしさん！\r\n明日も元気に冒険するため、\r\n今のうちにしっかり休みましょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1fcc56382a7bc3567a51dc0bec76f1d155b79a132084b11325b7e705f04fa04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec70baf3524aa5bb379bfabd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪を割って咲く花のように、\r\nたくさんの可能性が芽吹く…\r\n私も、輝く花を咲かせますっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27b45eb81f4d2341f747c6c6c8ffaff93b4351b62f6b88aa869c8bfd473e7823",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:608e7e8c341c968207847ef0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雨が降っても、マントで払って\r\n進みましょう。濡れているだけの\r\n私ではありませんからねっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa3d8ab6083dbfe81da7a149bbee308cc287834921ed4f48b6ad71e3002c8c85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c8f99d4212e6bf72c2f26f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "実家にも、美術館のように\r\n芸術作品が飾ってあるんです。\r\nフレスコ画からVRまで、幅広く！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5247f1e134ac69801d4515e85b3e9e0978bcaf90999c6cb6274e0a555ffccdb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe5d38fe5414e7ef9d2fc848",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手、冷えてしまっていそうですね…\r\nあ！温めてさしあげましょうか？\r\n私の手は手袋でほかほかですから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efe0538fee69b886292f5dc6c451641a9a17932ef4abcf5a69e0af79b2375c1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58c5ef3656e4b74001351722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この剣で、どんな困難も\r\n打ち砕くさまを…どうぞ最高の席で\r\nご覧くださいませ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "327eda5c7f5f5e19f4ab0f164a2750efe7593514a972a56cac56c02d82bea310",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c38023e8dd07e5fa15b002e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさんの髪も、\r\n巻き巻きしてさしあげましょうか？\r\nきっと可愛いですよ、お揃いで♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeaa57bfd39faab48aacd96390ed6975d9381c5157c56137b5d763ed67131f3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f12be01537aca7895754fb3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们立刻开始吧。\r\n来吧，请给我指示！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bea7567527c76e59246bb545eedca35ace61608a3bc67a7abfb68cd4773804c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:292d9749fa3b28ea1d21f001",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張ります",
      "source_fingerprint": "13e2fad2c09664edd514ee8bb83e7ef7f3bb5ba57f86655d92f5faaaa505bb4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5233ea2c7bca2ba4513a9c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请问今天该\r\n进行什么项目呢？\r\n可以请你告诉我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a580027b9f00a9b52034d1f0542d6da4097ef8dce75a33f31f7787c38617fd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fad2fe15e31acd0caf3f60ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时\r\n都要常保光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09986483350c4959ed2981ec2491c6f74ee33623b8564cceefa810f5bfad6a7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c069ab3a60674f013aba640e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在想着\r\n下次要破除哪种魔咒。\r\n呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8501a0b87648d31bf3fcc1a5498f268402d1022ffd54f0fbd803b3314bd43569",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ee81b9c48bc2b2ef363b39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你有喜欢的宝石吗？\r\n喜欢什么颜色的？\r\n还有喜欢什么形状的？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b563f7b4c3a0fe3b6af6f0894907907523f7bff0a637a670af717649730d7c3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f3832b19c5da2a27de5e184",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "思考未来时我总是感到很快乐。\r\n我会想象着训练员将怎么\r\n帮助我绽放光芒呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "391a4ea4b81a8e1a0c30957479a0a69640806bda5313fe8b8f3eec52d2c7b479",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83da3e0416eb841a268e5443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我缔造的新纪录，\r\n也会成为你的纪录。\r\n……不觉得这样很棒吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bed748869b04673230fa8e153bc10bc986eaff9fe0d404ecc500344f48add3e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26364ae4ecea1da5ba957912",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听到是特别的训练，\r\n令人不禁既兴奋又期待呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c997ff191cd27a52229190cd40a41e9d4096b4b25e5ecf5f959e4e5197a34c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d11f76c49ba14b41cfc385b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为巫女，为了拿出在神明面前\r\n也不会感到羞愧的表现，\r\n我要全力以赴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a40b3a52277a37ebb310d863af229bf2971909a057a3f553958281fdd43c24f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d52f6fbec0eb9af13e028c75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很清楚……\r\n小北现在也正在努力。\r\n所以我也不能输给她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5409e098242d85f756f26b9c80e03c7301ae3c686f05009c71c992f8c31d047a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9201f33192e80c3ba460d602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要做什么呢？\r\n还是去问神明……不行，\r\n太依赖神明是不好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b400b39cc253d9a75f2b2d328d6e46b1893f21f227c6e7d996c61c5c526e4991",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2f4d8aa86cca02e81a9c24f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对这件衣服发过誓。\r\n无论是什么样的训练，\r\n我都会全心全力地投入！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8be4bcd4e98251739b9b8b51e6f42a0f39952f9179771d791c5d6a0ecee804ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b28f7b062b66983901def6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自己的实力每天都在变强……\r\n我最近似乎越来越常\r\n切身感受到这点了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62f549206708031de04a735ad90e1c0965b39401a48fd5e85c67052be126d196",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a711c76a6f05809260b940d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得爬山和追求梦想很像。\r\n无论路途多么辛苦，只要有巅峰在，\r\n就能持续向前迈进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee3ee2e2b779f4cc5eb9f88d4a0e8e7770266d163e6a88d547e9793c1da4f897",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5562cec21f8309d1e9607114",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚必定会结束，朝阳必定\r\n会升起……只要这么想，无论置身\r\n什么样的黑暗，我都能继续前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbf04c9076bc8135b157e0ef7c9f9679eec69c21ba0f1d32f8947d4d52cdb32f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6a33c749914c73f4578265b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、どんな試練でもどうぞ！\r\n必ずや打ち砕いてみせますよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "212da55caf686af6a753c2a880c1557a5ee2f093b8e3528b11f8dd4362e7084b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3c0484b599c2eaa1b82ad2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自然の中でのトレーニングって、\r\n素敵ですよね。冒険や探検のようで\r\n胸がときめいてしまいますっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75f2ab45ad34b7b0efa7c661695a12db5ca9484c8cdb4d0e00caa3ff7f6cef7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:039e34fdfefd86b39c0c730a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレセン学園のトレーニング施設…\r\nもう少し敷地を広げるとしたら\r\n予算はいくらになりそうでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d46e34524aba8697142e5b4cc7d73256bc700a908209ee54f1973104d641ff3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa2593f2179ca9ee96a930ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "重い芝にも慣れておかなければ…\r\n雨ごいの流儀、フクキタルさんなら\r\n知っているでしょうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57cb223177d36e467e029c3dd23970fc77adc4fe1e40fa618958e5757842e5e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21be4ffca6959b08f0880948",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ！チャレンジチャレンジ、\r\nまたチャレンジです！\r\n挑戦しなくては始まりませんっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c47c62103711fc43c921f417daa8706c74c5ab86cb80f6f6f3f94d1431416e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e7c2541df394917d39c1002",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凱旋『門』って優しい響きですね。\r\nだって、迎え入れてくれる意志が\r\nあるということでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfab35db566359c4dde6b09f816e65c88558c647e8a5fa0a163cdea0d850a595",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1594bcfaa0d4d5010dc8be40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントできる日が楽しみです。\r\n『凱旋門賞ウマ娘のトレーナー』\r\nという勲章を！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9907918f454051ddbb8b5816e80010947ba57ee2de0bc31fdd82ad34d19d01b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1570d7eac42b9ac3097cdd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真庆幸相信了你，与你携手共进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1569cb23f9171ff6929b5be2529a43994b9f8222d601facfdb81809ebb69cf9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1067",
        "93000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
